      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-12-30T03:20:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If you have no cards in hand, then you have no cards in hand.&nbsp; Kinda sucks.&nbsp; Especially if there's anything in the villain or environment play areas which is making you discard the card you draw at end of turn before your next turn starts; you end up just not ever having any more cards to play unless you can correct the situation.&nbsp; Those games are usually losses.</p>",
